  "changelog": "- Initial release of MBA / EMBA thesis writing guidance for Chinese management programs.\n- Covers topic selection, five-chapter outlines, chapter-specific writing, evidence-based argumentation, blind review self-check, and defense preparation.\n- Supports multiple directions: marketing, HR, operations, quality, finance, strategy, digitalization, and general management\u2014does not default to marketing templates.\n- Strict boundaries: no fabricated data, cases, references, or outsourcing of critical decisions; prioritizes user-led judgment.\n- Guidance follows school-specific requirements and emphasizes concise, human-like writing style without mechanical tone or overwrought transitions.\n- Includes file-based workflows, checklists, and principles for each thesis stage; differentiates between what AI can assist with and where human judgment is mandatory.",
